WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:24.563
"Good morning," said Mr. Grill.

2
00:00:24.564 --> 00:00:28.769
"We will do something new today!"

3
00:00:28.770 --> 00:00:32.593
"Will we go fast?" asked Zippy.

4
00:00:32.594 --> 00:00:35.131
He looked at Eddy and grinned.

5
00:00:35.132 --> 00:00:37.419
Eddy frowned.

6
00:00:37.420 --> 00:00:41.416
"Will we tell jokes?" asked Poppy.

7
00:00:41.417 --> 00:00:44.465
"Nope," said Mr. Grill.

8
00:00:44.466 --> 00:00:58.466
"Follow me!"

9
00:00:58.467 --> 00:01:02.835
The teacher drove down the road.

10
00:01:02.836 --> 00:01:06.003
Eddy saw lots of trees.

11
00:01:06.004 --> 00:01:09.673
"Hmm," he thought.

12
00:01:09.674 --> 00:01:18.546
"Where are we going?"

13
00:01:18.547 --> 00:01:22.210
"We're here!" said Mr. Grill.

14
00:01:22.211 --> 00:01:27.043
Eddy saw a wide path.

15
00:01:27.044 --> 00:01:30.212
It led into the woods.

16
00:01:30.213 --> 00:01:32.796
Mr. Grill smiled.

17
00:01:32.797 --> 00:01:36.004
"We're going off-road!"

18
00:01:36.005 --> 00:01:38.182
Eddy smiled.

19
00:01:38.183 --> 00:01:40.772
"Wow!" he said.

20
00:01:40.773 --> 00:01:43.501
"Cool!" said Jeb.

21
00:01:43.502 --> 00:01:46.543
"Fun!" said Dipper.

22
00:01:46.544 --> 00:01:49.922
"Yay!" said Poppy.

23
00:01:49.923 --> 00:01:52.882
"I hope the path is bumpy!"

24
00:01:52.883 --> 00:01:55.296
Zippy frowned.

25
00:01:55.297 --> 00:01:58.833
"This stinks!" he cried.

26
00:01:58.834 --> 00:02:04.538
"I hate going off-road!"

